Test XXE defenses in a controlled environment:

```bash
# Docker-based lab with vulnerable XML endpoint
docker run -d --name xxe-lab -p 8080:8080 spring-xxe-testbed:latest
# Send crafted XXE payload to verify parser hardening
curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/xml -H "Content-Type: application/xml" -d '<?xml version="1.0"?><!DOCTYPE foo [<!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM "file:///etc/passwd">]><data>&xxe;</data>'
```

## Security Testing Checklist

- **SAST scanning**: Configure SonarQube XML rules to detect `DocumentBuilderFactory` without `setFeature(DISALLOW_DOCTYPE)` calls
- **DAST validation**: Run OWASP ZAP XXE scanner against all XML-accepting endpoints
- **Penetration testing**: Test out-of-band XXE (OOB-XXE) using Burp Collaborator to detect blind XXE vulnerabilities
